OL,3,GNEWSADate set for closure of 24-hour
OL,4,Acare service
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 24-hour telecare alarm service
OL,7,Fsupporting vulnerable and elderly
OL,8,Fpeople in a remote area of Derbyshire
OL,9,Fis to close in just under a fortnight,
OL,10,Fa council has announced.
OL,12,FCarelink users in the High Peak - who
OL,13,Fpay about #10 per week for the service
OL,14,F- can summon help for emergencies at
OL,15,Fthe press of a button and be met by
OL,16,Ftrained staff within the hour.
OL,18,FAlmost 3,000 calls were made to the
OL,19,Fservice last year, many of which were
OL,20,Ffor falls in people's homes.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,363,360,200,160,0,100
