OL,3,GNEWSADate set for closure of 24-hour
OL,4,Acare service
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut Labour-led High Peak Borough
OL,7,FCouncil said in July it could no longer
OL,8,Fsafely staff the discretionary service,
OL,9,Fand it would now close on 19 October.
